personalize|Adaptation to individual learner needs distinct from merely naming an object. Source key American spelling preserved, British example form is noted rather than identity merged; Vietnamese exercise tailoring faithful.
sacrifice|Giving up/value-loss noun and purposeful surrender verb are separate source ordinals. Living-space tradeoff and donated afternoon align; not restricted to religious killing or physical injury.
warn|Risk information not guaranteed harm or fabricated expertise. Loose stones/path and guide recipients translate correctly; about/of and negative infinitive constructions checked.
apparently|Reported/seeming claim preserves uncertainty, neither certainty nor automatic falsehood. Delayed train example has Vietnamese nghe nói and no real schedule assertion.
human|Relational adjective and person noun have separate supported ordinals. Communication display and fictional robot distinguish POS; biology note avoids implying humans are outside animal classification.
